  ],
  blogSlug: 'window-cleaning-thousand-oaks-a-complete-guide-for-homeowners',
  blogTitle: 'Window Cleaning Thousand Oaks: A Complete Guide for Homeowners',
  geo: { lat: 34.1706, lon: -118.8376 },
  // See the localBrief note in CityLanding.astro. Thousand Oaks is the second city to get one,
  // and the first ALREADY-INDEXED page to get one, so it tests a different question than the
  // Santa Barbara brief does (rank movement on a crawled page, not crawling of an uncrawled one).
